meta {
  name: v2
  seq: 12
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Schedule and location come ONLY from the contract's EVENT booking — there
  is no fallback to the legacy `Event` columns. See
  `odd/tasks/event-fields-deprecation.md`, "Phase 1b".

  When the contract has no non-deleted EVENT booking:
    - serviceStartsAt, serviceEndsAt, venueName, mapsUrl are all null
    - bookingId is null
    - status is "finished"

  These deprecated v1 event fields are NOT returned by v2 and must not be
  sent to any v2 request (v2 is read-only anyway):
    serviceStartsAt, serviceEndsAt, venueName, serviceLocationUrl,
    serviceTypeId, printTemplate, printTemplates, decorativeIcon

  v2 also has no `scheduleSource` field (removed once the event fallback
  was dropped — schedule is always sourced from the booking or absent).
  Write endpoints (create/update event, and creating/updating the EVENT
  booking) stay on v1 / the `bookings` collection.
}
